-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1102: the module `export-imported-constant.l4` imports.
-- The first four are CLOSED constants (they read nothing but numbers and each
-- other), which `l4 export dmn` copies into the importing model as decisions.
-- The last two are not: `default colour` reads a constructor of a type this
-- module declares, and `weekly hours at` takes an input.

`hours per day` MEANS 8
`days per week` MEANS 5
`the longest week` MEANS `hours per day` TIMES `days per week` PLUS 2
`the threshold` MEANS 100

-- never read by the importer, so never copied
`an unused constant` MEANS 7

DECLARE Colour IS ONE OF red, green
`default colour` MEANS red

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `weekly hours at` f IS 42 TIMES f
